flowchart TD
    Android[Android NotificationManager] -->|posts notification| Listener[FocusListenerService]
    Listener --> Gate{Focus active?}
    Gate -->|no| Allow[Allow notification]
    Gate -->|yes| Classify[Package role and safety exceptions]
    Classify -->|call, alarm, OTP, urgent, VIP| Allow
    Classify -->|role Allow| Allow
    Classify -->|role Block in focus| Hold[Snooze notification until scheduled release]
    Classify -->|role Smart| Estimate[Local estimate and decision rules]
    Estimate -->|allow| Allow
    Estimate -->|defer| Hold
    Estimate -. comparison only .-> Lab[Counterfactual Lab]
    Hold --> Store[Local event store and Inbox]
    Allow --> Store
    Focus[Focus timer, app roles, pause, release] --> Listener
    Focus --> DND[Optional Android DND policy]
    DND -. saves and restores prior filter .-> Android
    UI[AttentionTwin screens and diagnostics] <--> Store
    Lab --> Offline[Offline qualitative comparison]
    Lab -. optional configured request .-> API[FastAPI backend]
    API --> Synthetic[Synthetic-data model and heuristic comparison]
    Synthetic --> Lab

    classDef caveat stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
    class Lab,API,Synthetic caveat;
